# Implementation Plan — V2-09A Procedural Motif Dataset Foundation

Build a deterministic procedural synthetic-data foundation (`packages/synthetic_motifs/`) for visual motif detection research. This includes parametric vector primitives, composition graphs, exact geometric ground truth (bbox, polygon, OBB, raster mask), domain randomization (geometric, photometric, imaging, material, occlusion), multi-format exporters (canonical JSON, COCO, YOLO detect, YOLO OBB, YOLO segment), CLI tools, validation suite, and governance policies.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Frozen Core Invariants**:
> - **Visual Labels Only**: Labels are strictly `VisualCandidateKey` enum keys (`star_like`, `niche_like`, `tree_like`, etc.). Zero cultural claims, symbolism, dynasties, historical periods, or personality attributes.
> - **Synthetic GT != Real-World Accuracy**: Procedural shapes represent synthetic visual geometry ground truth for detection evaluation; they do not establish historical authenticity.
> - **No Model Downloads & No Training**: V2-09A develops dataset generation and validation infrastructure only. Zero model weights downloaded, zero YOLO training, zero database mutations.
> - **Offline & Reproducible**: Fully deterministic given master seed, generator version, and scene specifications.

## Proposed Architecture & Structure

```
packages/
└── synthetic_motifs/
    ├── __init__.py
    ├── registry.py             # SyntheticMotifRegistry & 17 VisualCandidateKey definitions
    ├── geometry.py             # Vector primitives, Point, Polygon, BBox, OBB, Homography, Clipping
    ├── primitives/
    │   ├── __init__.py
    │   ├── geometric.py        # Star, Octagon, Lozenge, Rosette, Comb, Hook, Lattice
    │   ├── organic.py          # Palmette, Lotus, VineScroll, CloudBand, Tree, Horn, HumanFigure
    │   └── unmapped.py         # Controlled abstract glyphs / unmapped visual forms
    ├── renderers/
    │   ├── __init__.py
    │   └── base.py             # Vector-to-raster instance rendering and mask generation
    ├── composer.py             # CarpetComposer: background, borders, central, corners, lattices
    ├── transforms.py           # Geometric transforms (perspective, rotation, scale, crop)
    ├── randomization.py        # Photometric, imaging noise, fiber textures, occluders
    ├── annotations.py          # SyntheticMotifInstanceGT, SyntheticCarpetSample, Provenance DTOs
    ├── exporters/
    │   ├── __init__.py
    │   ├── canonical_json.py   # Source-of-truth JSON format
    │   ├── coco.py             # COCO 1.0 format
    │   ├── yolo_detect.py      # YOLO normalized [class_id, xc, yc, w, h]
    │   ├── yolo_obb.py         # YOLO normalized 8-point OBB [class_id, x1, y1, ... x4, y4]
    │   └── yolo_segment.py     # YOLO normalized polygon segmentation
    ├── manifest.py             # SyntheticMotifDatasetManifest & scene signature / leakage checks
    ├── validation.py           # Oracle integrity tests (mask/bbox/OBB/homography consistency)
    └── cli.py                  # CLI commands: generate, validate-dataset, dry-run
```

