### Manual / CLI Verification
1. **Dry-Run CLI**:
   ```bash
   python -m packages.synthetic_motifs.cli generate --samples 200 --seed 42 --dry-run
   ```
2. **Generate Acceptance Dataset & Validate**:
   ```bash
   python -m packages.synthetic_motifs.cli generate --samples 200 --seed 42 --output data/synthetic/acceptance_samples
   python -m packages.synthetic_motifs.cli validate-dataset --dataset-path data/synthetic/acceptance_samples
   ```
